{
    "word": "handbeweging",
    "lang_code": "nl",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [],
        "ru-extract.jsonl": [],
        "nl-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                "word": "handbeweging",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "f3539d73-8256-44b7-9dc5-167d246f00e9",
                        "entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "handbewegingen"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8926346b-00f3-4633-a28d-f37605487627",
                        "entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "singular"
                        ],
                        "form": "handbeweginkje"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "6eb7c350-39ee-4f98-af18-e5df19a667bc",
                        "entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "handbeweginkjes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c07b000f-69af-3295-a839-a4f1d9d0c793",
                        "entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "het bewegen van de hand voor het verrichten van een handeling"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2b7f166e-87a3-4c46-82e3-7d8a6f216c35",
                                "sense_id": "c07b000f-69af-3295-a839-a4f1d9d0c793",
                                "text": "Omdat het apparaat niet is uitgerust met een pincode (zoals bijvoorbeeld op je smartphone) kunnen hackers er gemakkelijk nieuwe software op installeren. Je kan de bril wel vergrendelen met een bepaalde handbeweging, maar dat doet lang niet iedereen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "47bd6441-15ea-48d4-9802-c94a3e9272cf",
                                "sense_id": "c07b000f-69af-3295-a839-a4f1d9d0c793",
                                "text": "De rechtbank vroeg S. hoe het mogelijk was om tijdens een worsteling een mes te pakken en open te klappen. De verdachte zei dat hij dat met een handbeweging langs zijn been heeft gedaan."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e563cf7d-b26a-3080-837f-fc8743b531ea",
                        "entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een beweging met de hand als vorm van communicatie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ca2ed3f-44a0-4b64-a1a0-c1d21047481e",
                                "sense_id": "e563cf7d-b26a-3080-837f-fc8743b531ea",
                                "text": "De officier van justitie las vandaag de aanklacht voor en beloofde met nieuw bewijs over de schuld van Mubarak te komen. Met een handbeweging gaf Mubarak aan niet te willen reageren op de aanklacht. Daarna verdaagde de rechter de zaak tot 8 juni."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "728c32cb-1109-4261-8a82-73f59e825f3f",
                                "sense_id": "e563cf7d-b26a-3080-837f-fc8743b531ea",
                                "text": "Van Lysebeth wist haar met een kort woord en een handbeweging van het toneel te krijgen, waarna Ji-young alsnog op het podium verscheen om de prijs in ontvangst te nemen. \"Ik kan het niet geloven\", reageerde ze. \"Dit lijkt niet echt, misschien moet ik nog wakker worden.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "199aed63-e043-4609-ab90-c9860edd7468",
                        "source_entry_id": "8124a588-3428-3e77-8d61-006dca1117a3",
                        "source_sense_id": "c07b000f-69af-3295-a839-a4f1d9d0c793",
                        "source_sense_description": "het bewegen van de hand voor het verrichten van een handeling",
                        "target_lang_word": "gesture",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gesture",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf32aedf-ec12-3cfa-9eae-ac850d0b209e",
                                        "entry_id": "3f365118-9ecc-32f9-a0a5-bf4359cfa861",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A motion of the limbs or body, especially one made to emphasize speech."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9c5948d5-dc5d-40d3-a1b4-f8c648b66a6c",
                                                "sense_id": "cf32aedf-ec12-3cfa-9eae-ac850d0b209e",
                                                "text": "The middle-finger gesture is really a nonverbal swear."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a5aaa098-0074-48d1-ac34-1a4b037086df",
                                                "sense_id": "cf32aedf-ec12-3cfa-9eae-ac850d0b209e",
                                                "text": "Grace was in all her steps, heaven in her eye, / In every gesture dignity and love."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "53146f17-ba40-338a-af61-bc1ade3c6ec1",
                                        "entry_id": "3f365118-9ecc-32f9-a0a5-bf4359cfa861",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An act or a remark that serves as a formality or as a sign of attitude."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47c173cf-f3be-4f04-afe1-e786061081ec",
                                                "sense_id": "53146f17-ba40-338a-af61-bc1ade3c6ec1",
                                                "text": "We took flowers as a gesture of sympathy."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5831e8cf-0f0f-49bb-98a6-25396733bed6",
                                                "sense_id": "53146f17-ba40-338a-af61-bc1ade3c6ec1",
                                                "text": "But, with a gesture, she put a period to this dalliance—one shouldn't palter so on an empty stomach, she might almost have said."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c42a0489-cb7d-3223-8ec4-f6134e0cabfa",
                                        "entry_id": "3f365118-9ecc-32f9-a0a5-bf4359cfa861",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A motion made with a pointing device, or on a touchscreen, that is recognised by the system as a command."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa7f3a2a-0614-4f06-b21c-16647d762550",
                                                "sense_id": "c42a0489-cb7d-3223-8ec4-f6134e0cabfa",
                                                "text": "This Web browser can be controlled with mouse gestures."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "768afe71-b9f8-3944-a610-7be1225e0c6b",
                                        "entry_id": "3f365118-9ecc-32f9-a0a5-bf4359cfa861",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The manner of carrying the body; position of the body or limbs; posture."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33eb7c9d-3412-4e8a-b734-ee3856f624c4",
                                                "sense_id": "768afe71-b9f8-3944-a610-7be1225e0c6b",
                                                "text": "Accubation, or lying down at meals, was a gesture used by very many nations."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "gesture",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ffc7c6e-45f2-3d35-ae0e-e5698c2a7b77",
                                        "entry_id": "05936996-2233-3558-9586-a17dbcd028ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make a gesture or gestures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3cb97459-43cc-4db2-ba58-bedcf1fa10a4",
                                                "sense_id": "9ffc7c6e-45f2-3d35-ae0e-e5698c2a7b77",
                                                "text": "My dad told me never to gesture with my hands when I talk."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f14b5a4-f7cd-43bb-80fb-9d6fe462ffe0",
                                                "sense_id": "9ffc7c6e-45f2-3d35-ae0e-e5698c2a7b77",
                                                "text": "Never gesture at someone using your middle finger: it may be perceived as an insult."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "46805cfe-2340-30ee-9b1e-bc708fb125b8",
                                        "entry_id": "05936996-2233-3558-9586-a17dbcd028ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express (something) by a gesture or gestures."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c416a589-4c9f-49cf-853a-2b1c6e0ef9dd",
                                                "sense_id": "46805cfe-2340-30ee-9b1e-bc708fb125b8",
                                                "text": "He gestured his disgust."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a43ba02a-7b3c-3d96-a40c-1270f244547f",
                                        "entry_id": "05936996-2233-3558-9586-a17dbcd028ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To accompany or illustrate with gesture or action."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8ed5b5ea-c8ae-4836-9b10-e87ed03b0d04",
                                                "sense_id": "a43ba02a-7b3c-3d96-a40c-1270f244547f",
                                                "text": "It is not orderly read, nor gestured as beseemeth."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8aab2f84-77f1-301c-9827-d301826c13b1",
                                        "entry_id": "05936996-2233-3558-9586-a17dbcd028ba",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To express or signal (to someone) by a gesture or gestures (to do something, go somewhere, etc)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82427123-2afc-475a-96d3-9408a8afb23e",
                                                "sense_id": "8aab2f84-77f1-301c-9827-d301826c13b1",
                                                "text": "[…] she sweepingly gestured him to the pillory — a chair upon the platform, facing the school. Here he suffered for the unusual term of an hour, with many jocular and cunning eyes constantly upon him; and, when he was released at noon, horrid shouts […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7d8b60a-1976-493a-9f07-d3517df88325",
                                                "sense_id": "8aab2f84-77f1-301c-9827-d301826c13b1",
                                                "text": "“Then what can you do?” she snapped. “I was told you were the best. Was that an idle boast?” He sighed and gestured her to sit down. “My lady, I—” “Countess,” she said sharply."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28767fa4-b815-47d7-8f7d-e9fc43c85789",
                                                "sense_id": "8aab2f84-77f1-301c-9827-d301826c13b1",
                                                "text": "Lorna gestured him to wait and handed the digital camera back to her. […] The guard gestured her to follow him. He seemed harmless without any guile as he stood facing her, waiting for her. She nodded and gestured, telling him to lead the way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
